# E-commerce Cart Item
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: E-commerce — a single Product/Quantity fact inside a Cart
# Case 15 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: ecommerce-cart.menata, ecommerce-product.menata
#
# Split out from ecommerce-cart.menata (corrected 2026-07-11): originally an inline
# `Table of (...)` field. Deliberately carries no Constraints, matching Cart's own
# "editable scratch state" framing (Add Item/Remove Item on Cart freely create and
# delete these rows — no stock check, no minimum, until Checkout converts the Cart
# into a real Order).

Cart Item

Fields

- Cart : Cart
- Product : Product
- Quantity : Number

